prospects.message:
Dear Hextar Chemicals team,

I am writing on behalf of Phyto Beht, a crop protection company registering and distributing plant protection products in Morocco.

We came across Hextar through your product registrations in Malaysia and Brazil, and we understand that your Port Klang site supplies customers in many export markets. We are expanding our portfolio and are looking for a reliable manufacturer of the following active ingredients, as technical grade and/or formulated products: Pyraclostrobin, Deltamethrin, Captan, Cymoxanil and Tebuconazole.

Could you kindly share:
- your product catalogue and the technical specifications (minimum purity, relevant impurities) for these molecules;
- the manufacturing site(s) and your existing registrations, in particular in OECD countries;
- for pyraclostrobin, the crystalline form of your technical material and your position regarding the remaining crystal-form patents;
- the availability of a technical dossier (5-batch analysis, GLP studies, letter of access) to support a registration with ONSSA, the Moroccan authority;
- indicative prices, MOQ, lead times and Incoterms;
- COA, SDS and TDS samples.

We would be glad to schedule a short call to discuss a possible long-term cooperation.

Best regards,
Abderrahmane Chraibi
Agricultural Engineer
Phyto Beht — Morocco
chraibi.agro@gmail.com
